WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.300
An invoice lands in the inbox. From a supplier, as a PDF.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.867
The agent reads the amount, date and supplier, and matches it to the purchase order.

3
00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:19.833
The entry is prepared. Ready in the accounting system with the right attachment.

4
00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:26.200
The bookkeeper approves. Exceptions always go to a person.

5
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.267
That is what we set up. In your systems, at a price agreed in advance.
